---
layout: base
title: Contact
permalink: /contact/
description: Contact Mobius Integration, a Tampa Bay tech partner. Send a message, ask about a package, or start with a free Tech Checkup.
---

<section class="px-4 pb-8 pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-16">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="h-display max-w-3xl">Contact us</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-5 max-w-2xl">Tell us what you need help with, or just what's frustrating you. A real person reads every message and replies within {{ site.responseTime }}.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 pb-16 md:pb-20">
  <div class="wrap grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-5 md:gap-12">

    <div id="booking" class="card md:col-span-3">
      {% set formSource = "contact" %}
      {% set formHeading = "Send us a message" %}
      {% set formButton = "Send message" %}
      {% set showSiteUrl = true %}
      {% include "partials/lead-form.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside class="space-y-6 md:col-span-2" aria-label="How to reach us">
      <div class="card-muted">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">How we reply</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li>We reply within {{ site.responseTime }}.</li>
          <li>{{ site.callHours }}.</li>
          <li>We serve local businesses across {{ site.region }}, including {{ site.areas | join(", ") }}.</li>
          {% if site.phone %}
          <li>Phone: <a class="link" href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>. Leave a voicemail and we call back within {{ site.responseTime }}.</li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if site.email %}
          <li>Email: <a class="link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
          {% endif %}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Not sure where to start?</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">The Free Tech Checkup is a 20-minute call and a written report on your website, booking flow and Google profile.</p>
        <p class="mt-4"><a class="btn-secondary" href="/free-checkup/">Book my free checkup</a></p>
      </div>
    </aside>

  </div>
</section>
